# ── Secrets & environment ─────────────────────────────────────
# `*.env` alone only catches `.env` and `foo.env`; it misses `.env.local`,
# `.env.staging` and friends, which is where a second set of real CRE secrets
# would land. Both forms are listed, with the example file exempted after them
# so the negation wins.
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.yaml
!secrets.yaml.example

node_modules/
bun.lock
